# gcloud CLI

Before any `gcloud` command:

```bash
export CLOUDSDK_CONFIG="$HOME/.config/gcloud-personal"
```

Use the personal Google account and project `sprout-app-development`, not work. Do not run `gcloud auth login` / `gcloud config set project` against the default `~/.config/gcloud`. Details: `docs/GCLOUD_CLI_PERSONAL.md`.
